Package: swaydesk-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Sway desktop components - package repository and signing key
 The APT source of the swaydesk packages (built on the openSUSE Build
 Service) and the public key that signs it. Installing this package
 adds the repository; updates of the key come through it.
